        - Install and run Omnisystem on your computers\n\
        - Use all 7 Omnisystem languages and frameworks\n\
        - Create applications and systems using Omnisystem\n\
        - Distribute your created applications (see distribution rights)\n\n\
        3. RESTRICTIONS\n\
        You may not:\n\
        - Reverse engineer or decompile Omnisystem\n\
        - Remove copyright notices or license agreements\n\
        - Rent, lease, or lend Omnisystem\n\
